<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle market inactive - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle market inactive - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was quiet, with no sales of slaughter steers or heifers confirmed, USDA said.</p>
<p>Inquiry and demand light.</p>
<p>Sales were confirmed this week on 87,600 head, including 24,500 head or about 28 percent of previously contracted or formulated cattle.</p>
<p>Confirmed - none    last week - 1,500  last year - none</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
</text>
